WEBVTT

00:00:03.953 --> 00:00:08.007
CANDY CANDY

00:00:10.818 --> 00:00:16.681
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:17.327 --> 00:00:23.463
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:27.364
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:27.399 --> 00:00:30.614
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:30.681 --> 00:00:36.163
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:37.215 --> 00:00:43.307
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:49.910
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:49.945 --> 00:00:56.310
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:59.265
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:59.455 --> 00:01:02.684
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:10.532 --> 00:01:16.671
A Good-bye from the carriage.

00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:24.984
That wonderful day spent
at the Brighton's house...

00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:28.469
...turned into a wonderful
memory for Candy and Annie.

00:01:29.077 --> 00:01:34.774
Candy and Annie felt almost as if
gentle mr. Brighton were their father.

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:42.956
You put meat and vegetables on a
stick this long, and then you grill it!

00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:45.993
And then you eat it?

00:01:46.191 --> 00:01:51.468
Yes. Right there on the grass!
It's so tasty!

00:01:54.116 --> 00:01:56.475
You don't understand me, after all...

00:01:57.055 --> 00:01:58.150
Uh...

00:01:58.313 --> 00:01:59.479
What is it, John?

00:01:59.692 --> 00:02:02.044
Is it okay to eat the bones, too?

00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:06.133
After you fry the meat and vegetables.

00:02:06.922 --> 00:02:11.211
I can't believe this.
Brightons are rich people!

00:02:11.246 --> 00:02:13.867
Then, you got to eat all you could?

00:02:14.081 --> 00:02:15.271
Of course!

00:02:15.632 --> 00:02:17.203
Incredible!

00:02:19.525 --> 00:02:22.053
What's up with you guys?

00:02:22.494 --> 00:02:26.181
You got to eat all you wanted!
I'm jealous!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.696
At least, you have your dreams..

00:02:29.731 --> 00:02:33.106
Candy!
Brightons are...!

00:02:33.141 --> 00:02:34.011
Annie!

00:02:36.981 --> 00:02:39.149
Brightons have come to visit us!

00:02:41.489 --> 00:02:44.416
Really!
Mr. Brighton!

00:02:44.451 --> 00:02:44.848
Candy!

00:02:48.318 --> 00:02:49.472
Good day!

00:02:49.965 --> 00:02:52.951
Good day to you, too!
You look well, Candy.

00:02:53.729 --> 00:02:56.720
I'm sorry I returned the other
day without telling anyone.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:59.008
Don't worry about it.

00:02:59.217 --> 00:03:00.396
Okay.

00:03:00.904 --> 00:03:04.763
Hey guys, this is the barbecue guy
I've been telling you about.

00:03:04.798 --> 00:03:06.633
Candy!
You're being rude!

00:03:08.007 --> 00:03:11.883
Oh, that's okay. I came today since
I'm the barbecue guy, after all!

00:03:12.074 --> 00:03:12.973
Clark!

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:15.624
Rightaway, sir.

00:03:16.113 --> 00:03:19.715
You came to make a barbecue for us?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.850
That's right.

00:03:20.885 --> 00:03:22.220
Really?

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.767
-Candy!
-That's wonderful!

00:03:25.143 --> 00:03:27.137
Everyone, let's help them!

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:35.011
-Mister, let me help!
-Me too!

00:03:35.507 --> 00:03:38.925
Alright then, take
these bricks into the garden.

00:03:51.721 --> 00:03:53.481
They're having so much fun!

00:03:55.211 --> 00:03:57.627
Thank you very much, Mr. Brighton.

00:03:57.662 --> 00:04:01.878
Oh, come on, barbecue is just
an excuse for me coming here.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.765
Oh! Actually...

00:04:12.689 --> 00:04:16.454
John! It's not done yet!
You'll get yourself burned.

00:04:18.384 --> 00:04:20.902
Can I eat five of them?

00:04:20.937 --> 00:04:22.844
Of course, eat all you want.

00:04:25.858 --> 00:04:28.605
We brought a lot of meat and vegetables.

00:04:33.122 --> 00:04:34.532
Here, it's done!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:38.112
It's hot!

00:04:39.965 --> 00:04:41.254
Here, Milly.

00:04:50.859 --> 00:04:52.164
Hey, Candy.

00:04:52.661 --> 00:04:53.983
What is it?

00:04:55.171 --> 00:04:58.263
Why did Mr. Brighton come here?

00:05:01.339 --> 00:05:05.307
What do you mean?
To make a barbecue for us, of course.

00:05:05.342 --> 00:05:06.605
It's not just that.

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:10.017
What else could it be?

00:05:12.006 --> 00:05:13.115
Maybe...

00:05:14.255 --> 00:05:19.535
Maybe he came to take away one of us.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.894
No way!

00:05:22.111 --> 00:05:23.897
No, it must be it.

00:05:35.157 --> 00:05:37.792
And so the barbecue ended, after all.

00:05:40.297 --> 00:05:43.873
You know...
I'm worried just a little bit.

00:05:44.548 --> 00:05:45.792
What about?

00:05:45.827 --> 00:05:51.988
Like you said, Mr. Brighton might take one
of us to make up for his late daughter.

00:05:52.023 --> 00:05:54.342
I don't know what to think of that.

00:05:56.145 --> 00:05:57.468
Candy!

00:05:58.038 --> 00:06:00.937
Sister Pony is calling you.
Come on!

00:06:01.322 --> 00:06:03.609
Geez, she's gonna preach again.

00:06:04.018 --> 00:06:05.659
I wonder what I did wrong today.

00:06:08.142 --> 00:06:09.118
See you.

00:06:12.699 --> 00:06:14.139
Enter.

00:06:18.137 --> 00:06:20.317
What's up with that knock?

00:06:21.204 --> 00:06:24.259
I wanted to have fun before
you chew me out!

00:06:24.411 --> 00:06:26.985
We're not going to scold you today.

00:06:27.292 --> 00:06:31.000
But... don't tell me you're going
to praise me.

00:06:31.035 --> 00:06:34.581
Candy...
What do you think of Mr. Brighton?

00:06:35.396 --> 00:06:39.972
Well... He's a rich gentleman...
I guess so-so.

00:06:40.007 --> 00:06:41.628
What do you mean, "so-so"?

00:06:41.663 --> 00:06:47.615
Well then... what would you say if
mr. Brighton expressed his wish to adopt you?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.150
Mr. Brighton.. adopt me...?!

00:06:55.075 --> 00:06:56.466
Candy is...

00:07:00.792 --> 00:07:04.762
Candy! We are being serious
about this!

00:07:04.976 --> 00:07:09.380
But... why would he want to
adopt a tomboy like me...

00:07:09.415 --> 00:07:10.959
That can't be true.

00:07:11.177 --> 00:07:16.564
Yes. It's true that you're tomboyish
and difficult to live with...

00:07:16.599 --> 00:07:23.980
But he said that he saw a gentle
soul hiding inside the tomboyish exterior.

00:07:24.015 --> 00:07:27.232
I...
I am not gentle.

00:07:27.363 --> 00:07:33.269
That's right, he's never seen the
kind of gentleness that you have...

00:07:33.474 --> 00:07:36.931
That's exactly what mr. Brighton
likes about you.

00:07:39.846 --> 00:07:45.073
Even though sister Lane and I will
feel lonely after you're gone...

00:07:45.108 --> 00:07:49.259
...you'll soon have to start thinking
about your own happiness.

00:07:50.966 --> 00:07:53.057
My own happiness...?

00:07:55.735 --> 00:07:57.089
Is somebody there?

00:07:58.924 --> 00:08:00.144
Annie!

00:08:11.282 --> 00:08:13.630
Candy... you'd better go...

00:08:14.402 --> 00:08:17.236
...become his daughter...

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.434
Annie.
You heard everything?

00:08:22.864 --> 00:08:27.179
Silly. You think I'd go so easily?

00:08:29.107 --> 00:08:32.851
You want your papa and mama, don't you?

00:08:33.365 --> 00:08:34.512
Annie...

00:08:36.175 --> 00:08:39.297
Haven't we promised each other that
we'd stay together forever?

00:08:39.765 --> 00:08:40.920
But...

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:43.320
Annie!

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:48.071
"You must obey what I said!"

00:08:48.106 --> 00:08:49.300
Candy!

00:08:53.919 --> 00:08:56.859
Thank you. You laid so many of them
today, didn't you?

00:08:58.826 --> 00:08:59.704
There she is!

00:09:00.159 --> 00:09:02.037
Huh? What's up, everybody?

00:09:02.739 --> 00:09:05.519
John? Did you pee in your bed again?

00:09:06.107 --> 00:09:07.692
Why do you want to know?

00:09:07.891 --> 00:09:10.177
It was that bad?

00:09:10.632 --> 00:09:13.338
And what if I ate from the barbecue?

00:09:15.766 --> 00:09:17.945
You wouldn't eat if you knew, right?

00:09:18.821 --> 00:09:20.527
I wouldn't eat for sure!

00:09:20.746 --> 00:09:22.834
Hold on, what are you talking about?

00:09:22.869 --> 00:09:24.495
You are leaving, Candy!

00:09:24.703 --> 00:09:25.856
John!

00:09:25.891 --> 00:09:28.006
Candy, are you leaving?

00:09:28.742 --> 00:09:31.788
Are you really going to mr. Brighton?

00:09:32.821 --> 00:09:36.057
Don't go!
I don't want you to go!

00:09:40.327 --> 00:09:42.306
Wait a minute, guys!

00:09:44.594 --> 00:09:45.943
Everybody is crying...

00:09:46.608 --> 00:09:49.251
My tears are running as well...

00:09:50.328 --> 00:09:55.660
You won't be the only one feeling
lonely after Candy is gone.

00:09:56.386 --> 00:10:02.133
Ever since she was a baby, Candy
lived together with sister Pony and I.

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:06.972
But... we mustn't stand in her way,
even though it brings grief to us.

00:10:07.454 --> 00:10:10.040
If you really like her,

00:10:10.075 --> 00:10:14.044
...you must not cry
while she is leaving.

00:10:14.079 --> 00:10:15.523
You understand?

00:10:19.315 --> 00:10:24.916
Next time, mr. Brighton will come
together with his wife.

00:10:24.951 --> 00:10:26.865
I hope that you won't be impolite to them.

00:10:27.309 --> 00:10:28.774
Sister Pony?

00:10:28.983 --> 00:10:30.772
What is it, Annie?

00:10:31.185 --> 00:10:33.246
I was wrong!

00:10:33.644 --> 00:10:38.720
I was thinking only about myself,
and I couldn't feel happy for Candy!

00:10:39.779 --> 00:10:41.553
Annie!

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:47.169
Annie, where are we going?

00:10:47.462 --> 00:10:48.961
Come this way!

00:10:52.324 --> 00:10:55.203
Candy... teach me how to climb a tree!

00:10:55.384 --> 00:11:00.764
To climb a tree...
Annie, aren't you afraid of heights?

00:11:00.765 --> 00:11:02.463
No, I'm not.

00:11:03.277 --> 00:11:08.483
But...
Why do you suddenly want to climb a tree?

00:11:09.789 --> 00:11:11.798
If I climb this tree,

00:11:14.164 --> 00:11:16.136
I could see you off...

00:11:16.536 --> 00:11:20.662
As you leave to mr. Brighton's house.

00:11:21.819 --> 00:11:23.136
Annie!

00:11:23.556 --> 00:11:25.371
Don't look at me like that!

00:11:28.314 --> 00:11:30.464
I'm not going!
They won't take me away!

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.483
Candy!

00:11:36.003 --> 00:11:40.555
Annie, I just thought of a
good way to stop them from taking me!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:51.124
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
I promise not to have made up
any dialogue during the CM break!

00:12:01.983 --> 00:12:04.353
She's tomboyish, and has a huge temper...

00:12:04.388 --> 00:12:06.296
...but she's gentle on the inside.

00:12:07.229 --> 00:12:10.604
I've never heard of such a girl.

00:12:10.639 --> 00:12:14.117
She has a lot going for it.
I'm sure you will like her.

00:12:15.432 --> 00:12:16.832
I can't wait!

00:12:17.262 --> 00:12:20.575
Here they come!
They're early!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.492
I must hurry.

00:12:42.152 --> 00:12:43.064
John!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.299
Did you do it again?

00:12:46.924 --> 00:12:47.865
Uh-huh.

00:12:48.502 --> 00:12:50.392
Great!
Move aside a bit!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.509
Uh, I'm sorry.

00:12:56.865 --> 00:12:59.392
You did great, John!

00:13:00.659 --> 00:13:03.839
Candy always gets mad when I do this...

00:13:07.607 --> 00:13:12.417
Mr. Brighton, welcome!
We've been expecting you!

00:13:12.796 --> 00:13:14.240
Where is Candy?

00:13:14.659 --> 00:13:16.506
She must have overslept...

00:13:16.541 --> 00:13:20.907
I would like to take her to my
mansion before the day is over.

00:13:20.918 --> 00:13:22.555
Is that so...

00:13:22.965 --> 00:13:28.634
Where is she? That huge-tempered
tomboy with a kind heart?

00:13:33.152 --> 00:13:34.968
Good morning, Mr. Brighton!

00:13:35.003 --> 00:13:37.669
Hello! This is my wife, Jane.

00:13:38.314 --> 00:13:40.488
That's a lot of work for such a small girl.

00:13:42.936 --> 00:13:45.195
Oh no, these are my sheets.

00:13:45.536 --> 00:13:47.277
Your sheets?

00:13:47.312 --> 00:13:52.296
I was so happy that I would be going,
that this sort of thing happened.

00:13:52.725 --> 00:13:55.274
You do this... every day?

00:13:56.342 --> 00:13:58.812
Yeah, every day since I was a baby.

00:13:59.706 --> 00:14:00.953
Darling?

00:14:03.549 --> 00:14:06.358
Uh... Mr. Brighton?

00:14:06.692 --> 00:14:07.979
Oh, Annie!

00:14:08.874 --> 00:14:12.725
The tea is done, please join us inside.

00:14:13.475 --> 00:14:15.822
Thank you. And you are?

00:14:16.255 --> 00:14:17.739
I'm Annie.

00:14:18.137 --> 00:14:20.982
Annie? That's a lovely name.

00:14:22.229 --> 00:14:23.628
Thank you very much.

00:14:24.725 --> 00:14:26.248
Darling, let's go.

00:14:30.582 --> 00:14:32.469
Looks good, Annie!

00:14:35.402 --> 00:14:39.048
Candy doesn't really have a habit
of wetting her sheets... right, sister Pony?

00:14:41.349 --> 00:14:43.805
Then, it was her little play...

00:14:44.962 --> 00:14:47.254
I don't like the way she pulled it off.

00:14:47.518 --> 00:14:48.638
Oh, my!

00:14:48.797 --> 00:14:52.763
If it means that she staged this bedwetting
because she doesn't like us...

00:14:52.798 --> 00:14:56.795
...then we'll do her a favor and
won't take her with us.

00:14:59.768 --> 00:15:04.427
There is no point in taking her
along if she doesn't want that.

00:15:04.661 --> 00:15:06.082
Hey, Jane.

00:15:06.258 --> 00:15:09.805
We won't take her then,
let her continue living here.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:11.476
Right, darling?

00:15:13.942 --> 00:15:15.147
Madam!

00:15:20.987 --> 00:15:24.003
Perfect, perfect, absolutely perfect!

00:15:26.412 --> 00:15:28.382
Annie, good news!

00:15:29.273 --> 00:15:30.144
Candy!

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.503
Now we won't have to be separated!

00:15:36.983 --> 00:15:38.937
I'm not regretting this.

00:15:41.011 --> 00:15:43.242
Why would you regret?

00:15:46.225 --> 00:15:48.299
I am going to stay with Annie...

00:15:48.334 --> 00:15:49.563
Annie?

00:15:55.843 --> 00:15:59.532
I wonder if my mama looks like her.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:08.591
Darling.. that looks like a pretty
nice girl, right?

00:16:09.284 --> 00:16:10.814
Huh?
Yeah...

00:16:21.616 --> 00:16:23.620
What did you talk about with sister Pony

00:16:28.042 --> 00:16:29.824
Something happened?

00:16:30.364 --> 00:16:34.142
Candy...
The Brightons have taken...

00:16:35.777 --> 00:16:38.116
...me as their daughter...

00:16:38.744 --> 00:16:40.013
Annie, you?

00:16:40.706 --> 00:16:45.266
This is so stupid. First they refuse
me, and this time they fixate on you.

00:16:46.884 --> 00:16:50.323
If you turn them down, they might
as well take Milly with them.

00:16:50.358 --> 00:16:50.972
No!

00:16:51.521 --> 00:16:55.301
Brighton's wife has specifically
asked for me.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.619
That's impossible!

00:17:00.015 --> 00:17:00.960
Candy!

00:17:05.338 --> 00:17:08.045
You don't have to comply. You
can still turn them down.

00:17:08.862 --> 00:17:10.267
It's already arranged.

00:17:10.962 --> 00:17:14.733
Of course...
...you tried to turn them down?

00:17:15.894 --> 00:17:17.768
I'm sorry, Candy!

00:17:18.639 --> 00:17:21.654
Annie.
You...

00:17:21.689 --> 00:17:23.013
You...

00:17:24.123 --> 00:17:25.696
You want to go.

00:17:26.174 --> 00:17:27.995
Forgive me, Candy!

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:34.984
I want my papa and mama.. I just want
to live together with gentle papa and mama!

00:17:35.019 --> 00:17:35.960
Me too.

00:17:36.824 --> 00:17:38.642
Me too.

00:17:38.677 --> 00:17:41.850
But... I didn't want to part from Annie.

00:17:46.336 --> 00:17:47.487
Candy!

00:17:47.644 --> 00:17:48.880
Annie, you idiot!

00:17:49.318 --> 00:17:50.977
You are not my friend anymore!

00:17:56.008 --> 00:17:59.493
I hate you!

00:18:04.537 --> 00:18:08.150
Annie, you idiot! I hate you!
I hate you so much!

00:18:21.063 --> 00:18:23.750
Annie is...

00:18:24.166 --> 00:18:25.230
Candy.

00:18:27.174 --> 00:18:28.300
Annie?

00:18:33.189 --> 00:18:35.745
I'm sorry, Candy.

00:18:36.942 --> 00:18:40.840
You stood in the rain,
all this time...?

00:18:41.376 --> 00:18:44.524
I cried together with you.

00:18:46.465 --> 00:18:49.482
With me... barefooted...?

00:18:52.002 --> 00:18:55.656
Things have changed. From now on,
we will have to part our ways.

00:18:55.818 --> 00:18:56.922
Candy!

00:18:59.307 --> 00:19:02.561
We had to part someday.

00:19:05.402 --> 00:19:07.983
Can you forgive me, Candy?

00:19:15.756 --> 00:19:19.125
Annie, you chose your own happiness.

00:19:19.833 --> 00:19:22.135
What should I do?

00:19:23.862 --> 00:19:28.465
Annie, go with them.
Go with them and become happy.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.658
Candy.

00:19:31.713 --> 00:19:35.834
Or would you rather throw
away this chance for happiness?

00:19:36.095 --> 00:19:37.424
Candy.

00:19:39.094 --> 00:19:40.579
Annie.

00:19:47.914 --> 00:19:50.925
Candy, take Kurin in return.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.729
Why don't you bring him along?

00:19:52.764 --> 00:19:55.372
Brighton's wife hates animals.

00:19:55.407 --> 00:19:57.997
I see. There's no helping it, then.

00:19:58.321 --> 00:19:59.380
Come, Kurin!

00:20:08.441 --> 00:20:11.808
-Incredible!
-She looks like a princess!

00:20:11.843 --> 00:20:16.068
Be careful not to get yourself dirty!
You look wonderful, Annie!

00:20:16.525 --> 00:20:21.591
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
thank you for everything!

00:20:22.346 --> 00:20:24.538
Be happy, alright?

00:20:24.573 --> 00:20:25.753
Thank you.

00:20:27.344 --> 00:20:28.743
Take care about Kurin, okay?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.907
He thinks you'll be coming back.

00:20:31.673 --> 00:20:33.254
Be a good boy, Kurin.

00:20:33.848 --> 00:20:36.173
Annie, you'll get your clothes dirty.

00:20:36.371 --> 00:20:37.526
Yes!

00:20:38.308 --> 00:20:39.898
Well then, everyone!

00:20:40.775 --> 00:20:43.513
Annie, banzai!

00:20:47.914 --> 00:20:49.225
Candy...

00:20:49.702 --> 00:20:50.792
Farewell.

